div.p:
Existing quotation marks within quote are recorded in choice. orig holds the mark in the source and reg
        holds the mark for the reading version. If it is omitted there, reg/ is empty. In long quotations, &quote;
        is shorthand for „ in orig, with reg left empty.

item.p:
Separately written radical sign and vinculum
The text-faithful version shows the radical sign and vinculum separately. The reading version joins them in modern radical notation.
dz-dx=\sqrt{\vphantom{0^0}}\,\overline{dx^{2}+dy^{2}}
dz-dx=\sqrt{dx^{2}+dy^{2}}
Anna Barbara Reinhart an Daniel I Bernoulli. Winterthur, Mai 1761, Bl. 92r (B_991171579678805501)
